        "title": "Find a sum or difference",
        "text": "How is $$\\frac{\\pi}{12}$$ related to $$\\frac{\\pi}{3}$$ and $$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$?",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h1"
        ],
        "title": "Related to known angles",
        "text": "Note that $$\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{4\\pi}{12}-\\frac{3\\pi}{12}=\\frac{\\pi}{12}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h3",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h2"
        ],
        "title": "Substitute",
        "text": "$$\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h4",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h3"
        ],
        "title": "Angle difference formula",
        "text": "Recall that $$\\tan(a-b)=\\frac{\\tan(a)-\\tan(b)}{1+\\tan(a)\\tan(b)}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h5",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h4"
        ],
        "title": "Apply the formula",
        "text": "$$\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\frac{\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)-\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}{1+\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h6",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "add398dT2-diag-P10a-h5"
        ],
        "title": "Substitute known special values",
        "text": "$$\\frac{\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)-\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}{1+\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{1+(\\sqrt{3})(1)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{1+\\sqrt{3}}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    }
